ng":false},{"text":["(rādhār mahimā ke jānata)","(gaura yadi nā āsita rādhār mahimā ke jānata)"],"translation":["Who would have known Śrī Rādhā’s glory? If Śrī Gaura would not have come, who would have known Śrī Rādhā’s glory?"],"isLong":false},{"number":"2","text":["madhura vṛndā-    vipina mādhurī","    praveśa chāturī sāra","varaja-yuvatī    bhāvera bhakati","    śakati ha-ita kāra?"],"translation":["Who would have the great expertise needed to enter into the sweetness of sweet Vṛndāvan? Who would have any qualification for the Vraja-gopīs’ ecstatic devotion?"],"isLong":false},{"number":"3","text":["gāo punaḥ punaḥ    gaurāṅgera guṇa","    sarala kariyā mana","e bhava-sāgare    emana dayāla","    nā dekhiye eka-jana"],"translation":["Sing Gaurāṅga’s glories again and again, keeping your heart simple. In the ocean of this material world, no one has ever seen anyone so merciful."],"isLong":false},{"number":"4","text":["(āmi) gaurāṅga baliyā    nā genu galiyā","    kemane dharinu de","vāsura-hiyā    pāṣāṇa diyā","    (vidhi) kemane gaḍiyāchhe"],"translation":["I chant ‘Gaurāṅga’, but have not melted (with love). How have I maintained this body? How has Providence made Vāsu a stone rather than a heart?"],"isLong":false}],"resources":{"audio":[{"title":"Srila B.S. Govinda Dev-Goswami Maharaj","embed_url":"https://soundcloud.com/kostya-netrebenko/23-yadi-gaura-na-haite-5","personSlug":"srila-b-s-govinda-dev-goswami-maharaj"},{"title":"Srila B.N. Acharya Maharaj","embed_url":"https://soundcloud.com/madhupuri/1-jadi-goura-na-hoito-acharya","personSlug":"srila-b-n-acharya-maharaj"},{"title":"Manasa Krishna Prabhu","embed_url":"https://soundcloud.com/huron/jadi-gora-na-hoto","personSlug":"manasa-krishna-prabhu"},{"title":"Sudarshan Prabhu","embed_url":"https://soundcloud.com/bharatimaharaj/sudarshan-prabhu-jadi-gaura-na","personSlug":"sudarshan-prabhu"}]},"hasWbw":false,"hasVersesText":true,"hasVersesTranslations":true,"hasLongVerses":false,"fullInlineWbw":false},"telegrap